          "section:Key Points to Remember"
        ],
        "exercise": null,
        "reason": "The combiner is exercised only when the reader chooses the three-argument reduce, and mapToInt(...).sum() sidesteps it; parallel-totals grades associativity and the identity, which every route must get right."
      },
      {
